@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #555555

start
:1. Freeze strategy, profile revision,
inputs, and old state;
:2. Compute let/with and every next
(reads old state + same inputs);
:3. Build complete candidate state
(no transition = keep old value);
:4. Compute intent/emit
(state = old, next = candidate);
:5. Apply safety constraints
(requested -> safe intent);
if (tick failed?) then (yes)
  :Commit nothing;
  :Host applies its
  safe-output policy;
  stop
else (no)
  :6. Commit state, outputs,
  and records together;
  :7. Real host only: apply
  safe intent to renderer;
  stop
endif
@enduml
